<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <!-- Import fonts, external files here -->
    <mj-title>KYC Verification</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>KYC Verification</mj-preview>

    <!-- Define device breakpoint here -->
    <mj-breakpoint width="400px" />
    <mj-font
      name="Inter"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;600;700;900&display=swap"
    />

    <mj-style inline="inline">
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color:#000000} .full-width-image
      { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; } .social-inline {
      display: inline-block !important; vertical-align: middle !important;
      width: auto !important; padding: 0 5px !important; } .social-icons-center
      { text-align: center !important; margin: 0 auto !important; }
      .social-icons-center table { margin: 0 auto !important; }.social-icons{
      display:flex !important;gap:2px !important }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="white">
    <!-- body-logo-hero-section -->
    <mj-wrapper>
      <!-- hero section -->

      <mj-section padding="0">
        <mj-column width="100%" padding="0"
          ><mj-image
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/danxk4ua5/image/upload/v1761858920/Banner_image_1_nhvzan.png"
            alt="hero-image"
            width="600px"
            padding="0"
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            css-class="full-width-image"
        /></mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- start greeting/intro section -->
      <mj-section padding="40px 25px 20px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="24px"
            font-weight="500"
            line-height="32px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            padding-top="30px"
            align="left"
          >
            Hi {{name}}
          </mj-text>

          <mj-text
            padding="20px 0"
            font-family="inter"
            font-weight="500"
            line-height="24px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            font-size="14px"
            color="#333333"
            align="justify"
          >
            At PinovX, we started with a simple question: Why is moving your own
            money so complicated? Between high bank fees, slow processing times,
            and confusing crypto exchanges, the "middleman" always seemed to
            win.
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text
            padding="10px 0"
            font-family="inter"
            font-weight="500"
            line-height="24px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            font-size="14px"
            color="#333333"
            align="justify"
          >
            We’ve changed that. From this moment on, you have a direct line to
            the world of virtual currencies. No more waiting hours or days for
            approvals or navigating 20-step verification processes for every
            single trade.
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text
            padding="10px 0"
            font-family="inter"
            font-weight="500"
            line-height="24px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            font-size="14px"
            color="#333333"
            align="justify"
          >
            Here’s what you can do right now:<br /><br />
            • Direct Funding: Link your Interac email and move CAD instantly.<br />
            • One-Tap Trading: Buy Bitcoin, Ethereum, and more without
            complexity.<br />
            • Borderless Sending: Send funds globally—fast, affordable,
            transparent.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- start button section -->

      <mj-section padding="10px 20px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-button
            href="https://pinovx.com"
            align="center"
            background-color="#189913"
            border-radius="42px"
            padding="20px 0"
            inner-padding="5.6px 22.4px"
            width="167.8px"
            height="39.2px"
            font-size="14px"
            font-weight="normal"
          >
            Go to Dashboard
          </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- end button section -->

      <mj-section padding="40px 25px 20px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            padding="0"
            font-weight="400"
            line-height="22px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            font-size="14px"
            color="#333333"
            >Need a hand? Our goal is to make this so easy you won't need a
            manual. But if you ever have a question, our
            <a href="mail:support@pinovx.com" style="color: #189913">support</a>
            team is just a chat away.<br />
            <br />
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="40px 25px 20px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            padding="0"
            font-weight="400"
            line-height="22px"
            letter-spacing="0"
            font-size="14px"
            color="#333333"
            >Best Regards,<br />

            <span
              style="
                font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
                font-weight: 500;
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 22px;
                letter-spacing: 0%;
                color: #14ae5c;
              "
              >PinovX</span
            >
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>




      <!-- Divider -->
      <mj-section padding="0 ">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#e5e5e5" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Social Media Icons -->
      <mj-section padding="30px 25px 20px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-social
            mode="horizontal"
            align="center"
            icon-size="32px"
            inner-padding="4px"
            padding="0 10px"
          >
            <mj-social-element
              name="instagram"
              href="https://www.instagram.com/wearepinovx/"
              background-color="#14ae5c"
              border-radius="16px"
              padding="0 5px"
            >
            </mj-social-element>

            <mj-social-element
              name="linkedin"
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pinov-inc/"
              background-color="#14ae5c"
              border-radius="16px"
              padding="0 5px"
            >
            </mj-social-element>

            <mj-social-element
              name="facebook"
              href="https://www.facebook.com/wearepinovx"
              background-color="#14ae5c"
              border-radius="16px"
              padding="0 5px"
            >
            </mj-social-element>

            <mj-social-element
              src="https://res.cloudinary.com/danxk4ua5/image/upload/v1761837336/Vector_zamib0.png"
              href="https://x.com/wearepinovx"
              background-color="#14ae5c"
              border-radius="16px"
              padding="0 5px"
            >
            </mj-social-element>
          </mj-social>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <mj-section padding="20px 0 0 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#e5e5e5" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Copyright -->
      <mj-section padding="20px 25px 10px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            font-size="11px"
            color="#777777"
            align="center"
            line-height="17px"
          >
            © {{currentYear}} PinovX. All rights reserved.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Disclaimer -->
      <mj-section padding="0 25px 20px 25px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            font-size="11px"
            color="#777777"
            align="center"
            line-height="17px"
          >
            You are receiving this email because you are registering to join the
            PinovX platform. This also shows that you agree to our Terms of Use
            and Privacy Policy.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Footer Links -->
      <mj-section padding="0 25px 30px 25px">
        <mj-group>
          <mj-column width="33.33%">
            <mj-text
              font-size="11px"
              align="center"
              padding="5px 0"
              line-height="17px"
            >
              <a
                href="https://pinovx.com/privacy-policy"
                style="color: #555555; text-decoration: underline"
              >
                Privacy Policy
              </a>
            </mj-text>
          </mj-column>
          <mj-column width="33.33%">
            <mj-text
              font-size="11px"
              align="center"
              padding="5px 0"
              line-height="17px"
            >
              <a
                href="https://pinovx.com/aml-policy"
                style="color: #555555; text-decoration: underline"
              >
                Aml Policy
              </a>
            </mj-text>
          </mj-column>

          <mj-column width="33.33%">
            <mj-text
              font-size="11px"
              align="center"
              padding="5px 0"
              line-height="17px"
            >
              <a
                href="https://pinovx.com/terms-of-use"
                style="color: #555555; text-decoration: underline"
              >
                Terms of Service
              </a>
            </mj-text>
          </mj-column>
        </mj-group>
      </mj-section>



    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
